<title>MEXICO: Banco del Atlantico acquires new branches.</title>
<headline>Banco del Atlantico acquires new branches.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican bank Banco del Atlantico has acquired 22 branches of Banco Interestatal, the National Banking Commission (CNBV) said on Monday.</p>
<p>The deal was signed on May 26 and went into effect on May 31, the CNBV said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said that in general terms Banco del Atlantico would acquire the fixed assets of the branches as well as assuming the liabilities of Banco Interestatal.</p>
<p>The estimated price of the transaction is 17 million pesos, CNBV said.</p>
<p>((--Robert Kozak, Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9559))</p>
